'''Pikachu the Movie Memorial''' ('''ピカチュウ･ザ･ムービーメモリアル''') is a segment exclusive to the Japanese version of ''[[Pokémon the Series: Diamond and Pearl]]'' that appeared from [[DP075]]—[[DP084]], temporarily replacing [[Professor Oak's Big Pokémon Encyclopedia]]. It describes the powers and abilities of each Pokémon protagonist of the first ten {{pkmn|movie|movies}}.

